二次型 $\displaystyle f\left(x_{1}, x_{2}, x_{3}\right)=\sum_{i=1}^{3} \sum_{j=1}^{3} i j x_{i} x_{j}$

(1) 写出 $f\left(x_{1}, x_{2}, x_{3}\right)$ 对应的矩阵;

(2) 求正交变换 $\boldsymbol{x}=\boldsymbol{Q y}$ 将 $f\left(x_{1}, x_{2}, x_{3}\right)$ 化为标准形;

(3) 求 $f\left(x_{1}, x_{2}, x_{3}\right)=0$ 的解
